# Frames on the app's clock: a shot every 80 ms for the first 1.2 s from the first frame.
# React's first paint moves through them (the grid fades in, the curve draws on, P rises);
# M0's skeleton has no motion yet, so its frames are alike. Two runs of this script give
# the same frames on every surface.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
frames first-paint every 80 for 1200
